 "output": "---\ntitle: ÜCONNECT ÜA ÜSTORAGE ÜACCOUNT\ndescription: ÜLEARN ÜHOW ÜTO ÜCONNECT ÜAN ÜEXISTING ÜSTORAGE ÜACCOUNT ÜTO ÜCONTOSO ÜSYNC.\nms.date: 08/14/2026\nms.topic: how-to\nauthor: contoso-docs\nms.author: docsteam\nms.service: contoso-sync\n---\n\n# <a id=\"connect-a-storage-account\"></a>ÜCONNECT ÜA ÜSTORAGE ÜACCOUNT\n\n[!INCLUDE [ÜPREREQUISITES ÜFOR ÜALL ÜHOW-ÜTO ÜGUIDES](../includes/prereqs.md)]\n\n:::image type=\"content\" source=\"media/connect-storage/overview.png\" alt-text=\"ÜDIAGRAM ÜTHAT ÜSHOWS ÜTHE ÜCLIENT, ÜTHE ÜSYNC ÜSERVICE ÜAND ÜTHE ÜSTORAGE ÜACCOUNT.\":::\n\n## <a id=\"choose-your-platform\"></a>ÜCHOOSE ÜYOUR ÜPLATFORM\n\n::: zone pivot=\"portal\"\n\n1. ÜSIGN ÜIN ÜTO ÜTHE ÜPORTAL.\n2. ÜSELECT **ÜSTORAGE** > **ÜCONNECT**.\n3. ÜENTER ÜTHE ÜACCOUNT ÜNAME ÜAND ÜSELECT **ÜSAVE**.\n\n::: zone-end\n\n::: zone pivot=\"cli\"\n\nÜRUN ÜTHE ÜFOLLOWING ÜCOMMAND:\n\n```azurecli\nctsync storage connect --account mystorage --container sync\n```\n\n::: zone-end\n\n> [!div class=\"nextstepaction\"] >\n[ÜCONFIGURE ÜRETENTION](retention.md)\n\n[!VIDEO https://learn.example/embed/connect-storage]\n",
